{"seq":2,"slug":"lineage-collection","title":"血缘自动化采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/lineage/lineage-collection","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"血缘自动化采集\">血缘自动化采集</h1><p>手动维护血缘就像手动维护 API 文档——初始成本高、很快过时、最终被放弃。一个中等规模的数据平台有数百个 ETL 作业、数千张表、数万列。人工记录它们之间的数据流转关系既不现实也不可靠。血缘采集必须自动化，而自动化的核心挑战是：如何在不侵入业务代码的前提下，精确捕获列级血缘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>SQL 解析</strong>：通过分析 SQL 语句的 AST 提取列级源-目标映射关系</li>\n<li><strong>执行计划拦截</strong>：捕获查询引擎实际执行的 LogicalPlan，获得包含动态 SQL 的精确血缘</li>\n<li><strong>OpenLineage 事件</strong>：管道工具在执行时主动发射的标准化血缘事件，包含 Job/Run/Dataset 三层</li>\n<li><strong>Facet 扩展</strong>：OpenLineage 通过附加 facet 实现血缘事件的可扩展性</li>\n<li><strong>血缘覆盖率</strong>：有血缘信息的数据资产数占总资产数的比率，目标 ≥ 90%</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"采集路径全景\">采集路径全景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Static[静态采集]&#10;        SP[SQL 解析]&#10;        MP[模型声明解析&lt;br/&gt;dbt/dataform]&#10;        CP[配置解析&lt;br/&gt;ETL 工具]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Dynamic[动态采集]&#10;        EP[执行计划拦截]&#10;        OL[OpenLineage 事件]&#10;        QH[查询历史日志]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Hybrid[混合方案]&#10;        SH[静态 + 运行时修正]&#10;    end&#10;    Static --&gt; Store[(血缘存储)]&#10;    Dynamic --&gt; Store&#10;    Hybrid --&gt; Store\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Static[静态采集]\n        SP[SQL 解析]\n        MP[模型声明解析&lt;br/&gt;dbt/dataform]\n        CP[配置解析&lt;br/&gt;ETL 工具]\n    end\n    subgraph Dynamic[动态采集]\n        EP[执行计划拦截]\n        OL[OpenLineage 事件]\n        QH[查询历史日志]\n    end\n    subgraph Hybrid[混合方案]\n        SH[静态 + 运行时修正]\n    end\n    Static --&gt; Store[(血缘存储)]\n    Dynamic --&gt; Store\n    Hybrid --&gt; Store</pre><p>四大主流采集路径各有优劣：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采集路径</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>时效性</th>\n<th>侵入性</th>\n<th>动态 SQL 支持</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SQL 解析</td>\n<td>列级</td>\n<td>代码提交时</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>dbt、存储过程、视图定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行计划拦截</td>\n<td>列级</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>Spark、Flink、数据库引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenLineage 事件</td>\n<td>表/列级</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>Airflow、Spark、dbt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询历史日志</td>\n<td>表级为主</td>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>Snowflake、BigQuery</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sql-解析采集\">SQL 解析采集</h2><p>SQL 解析是最直接的血缘采集方式：分析 SQL 语句的 AST（抽象语法树），提取 SELECT 列与 FROM/JOIN 表之间的映射关系。</p>\n<p><strong>解析过程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>词法分析</strong>——SQL 文本 → Token 序列</li>\n<li><strong>语法分析</strong>——Token 序列 → AST</li>\n<li><strong>语义分析</strong>——解析列引用、别名、子查询、CTE</li>\n<li><strong>血缘提取</strong>——从 AST 构建 (源列, 目标列, 转换类型) 三元组</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 输入 SQL&#10;INSERT INTO analytics.order_summary&#10;SELECT&#10;    o.customer_id,&#10;    SUM(o.amount) AS total_amount,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS order_count&#10;FROM warehouse.orders o&#10;WHERE o.status = &#39;completed&#39;&#10;GROUP BY o.customer_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 输入 SQL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> analytics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_summary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> warehouse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解析结果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>源列</th>\n<th>目标列</th>\n<th>转换类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>warehouse.orders.customer_id</code></td>\n<td><code>analytics.order_summary.customer_id</code></td>\n<td>DIRECT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>warehouse.orders.amount</code></td>\n<td><code>analytics.order_summary.total_amount</code></td>\n<td>AGGREGATE(SUM)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>warehouse.orders.*</code></td>\n<td><code>analytics.order_summary.order_count</code></td>\n<td>AGGREGATE(COUNT)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>SQL 解析的挑战</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>动态 SQL</strong>：<code>EXECUTE IMMEDIATE &#39;SELECT * FROM &#39; || table_name</code> 无法静态解析</li>\n<li><strong>UDF（用户定义函数）</strong>：函数内部的列映射对解析器不透明</li>\n<li><strong>方言差异</strong>：每种数据库的 SQL 方言都有独特语法</li>\n<li><strong>复杂嵌套</strong>：多层 CTE + 子查询 + 窗口函数的组合解析难度大</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主流 SQL 解析引擎：sqllineage（Python）、JSQLParser（Java）、sqlglot（Python，2026 年社区活跃度最高，支持 20+ 方言互转）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行计划拦截\">执行计划拦截</h2><p>执行计划拦截比 SQL 解析更精确，因为它捕获的是查询引擎<strong>实际执行</strong>的逻辑：</p>\n<p><strong>Spark Lineage</strong></p>\n<p>Spark 通过 <code>QueryExecutionListener</code> 接口暴露执行计划。在计划中，每个 <code>LogicalPlan</code> 节点包含输入输出关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"== Analyzed Logical Plan ==&#10;Aggregate [customer_id], [customer_id, sum(amount) AS total_amount]&#10;+- Filter (status = &#39;completed&#39;)&#10;   +- Relation warehouse.orders [customer_id, amount, status]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>== Analyzed Logical Plan ==</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Aggregate [customer_id], [customer_id, sum(amount) AS total_amount]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+- Filter (status = 'completed')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   +- Relation warehouse.orders [customer_id, amount, status]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过遍历 LogicalPlan 树，可以精确提取列级血缘——包括动态 SQL 生成的查询。</p>\n<p><strong>数据库引擎拦截</strong></p>\n<p>部分数据库支持运行时血缘采集：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Snowflake</strong>：<code>ACCESS_HISTORY</code> 视图记录每次查询的源列和目标列映射</li>\n<li><strong>BigQuery</strong>：<code>INFORMATION_SCHEMA.COLUMN_FIELD_PATHS</code> + Data Lineage API</li>\n<li><strong>Databricks</strong>：Unity Catalog 内置列级血缘</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"openlineage-标准采集\">OpenLineage 标准采集</h2><p>OpenLineage 是 Linux Foundation 治下的开放血缘标准，定义了血缘事件的统一 schema。支持 OpenLineage 的工具在执行时主动发射事件，消费者只需订阅即可获得标准化血缘数据。</p>\n<p><strong>核心事件模型</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;eventType&quot;: &quot;COMPLETE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;eventTime&quot;: &quot;2026-07-01T03:15:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;job&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;airflow://prod&quot;,&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;daily_order_aggregate&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;run&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;runId&quot;: &quot;a1b2c3d4-...&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;inputs&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;postgres://warehouse&quot;,&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;public.orders&quot;,&#10;      &quot;facets&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;schema&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;fields&quot;: [&#10;            { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;customer_id&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;INTEGER&quot; },&#10;            { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;amount&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;DECIMAL&quot; }&#10;          ]&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;outputs&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;bigquery://analytics&quot;,&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;order_summary&quot;,&#10;      &quot;facets&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;columnLineage&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;fields&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;total_amount&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;inputFields&quot;: [{ &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;postgres://warehouse&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;public.orders&quot;, &quot;field&quot;: &quot;amount&quot; }],&#10;              &quot;transformationType&quot;: &quot;AGGREGATE&quot;&#10;            }&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eventType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"COMPLETE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eventTime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-01T03:15:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"job\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"airflow://prod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily_order_aggregate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"run\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"runId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a1b2c3d4-...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"postgres://warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"public.orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"facets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INTEGER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DECIMAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bigquery://analytics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"facets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"columnLineage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"total_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"inputFields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"postgres://warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"public.orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"transformationType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AGGREGATE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>原生支持 OpenLineage 的工具（2026）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n<th>血缘粒度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Apache Airflow</td>\n<td><code>openlineage-airflow</code> 插件</td>\n<td>表级 + 自定义列级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Spark</td>\n<td><code>openlineage-spark</code> Listener</td>\n<td>列级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dbt</td>\n<td>内置 OpenLineage emit</td>\n<td>列级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Flink</td>\n<td><code>openlineage-flink</code></td>\n<td>表级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dagster</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>表级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Great Expectations</td>\n<td>质量 facet 发射</td>\n<td>表级（质量维度）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>OpenLineage 的 Facet 扩展机制</strong>：</p>\n<p>OpenLineage 通过 Facet 实现可扩展性——除了核心的 schema 和 lineage facet，可以附加：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dataQualityMetrics</code>：行数、null 计数、唯一值数</li>\n<li><code>processingEngine</code>：Spark 版本、资源配置</li>\n<li><code>ownership</code>：数据集的 owner 信息</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"查询历史日志采集\">查询历史日志采集</h2><p>对于无法安装插件或修改配置的环境，查询历史日志是最低侵入的采集方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Snowflake</strong>：<code>QUERY_HISTORY</code> + <code>ACCESS_HISTORY</code> 视图</li>\n<li><strong>BigQuery</strong>：Audit Log → BigQuery → 解析</li>\n<li><strong>Redshift</strong>：<code>SVL_STATEMENTTEXT</code> + <code>STL_SCAN</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种方式的精度通常限于表级（日志记录&quot;查了哪些表&quot;，但不一定记录列映射），且有延迟（日志异步写入）。但它的优势是<strong>零侵入</strong>——不需要修改任何管道代码或配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集架构设计\">采集架构设计</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Sources[数据源]&#10;        S1[Airflow&lt;br/&gt;OpenLineage]&#10;        S2[Spark&lt;br/&gt;Listener]&#10;        S3[dbt&lt;br/&gt;manifest]&#10;        S4[Snowflake&lt;br/&gt;ACCESS_HISTORY]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Bus[事件总线]&#10;        K[Kafka / Kinesis]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Consumers[消费者]&#10;        LN[血缘存储]&#10;        CA[数据目录]&#10;        AL[告警引擎]&#10;    end&#10;    Sources --&gt; Bus --&gt; Consumers\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Sources[数据源]\n        S1[Airflow&lt;br/&gt;OpenLineage]\n        S2[Spark&lt;br/&gt;Listener]\n        S3[dbt&lt;br/&gt;manifest]\n        S4[Snowflake&lt;br/&gt;ACCESS_HISTORY]\n    end\n    subgraph Bus[事件总线]\n        K[Kafka / Kinesis]\n    end\n    subgraph Consumers[消费者]\n        LN[血缘存储]\n        CA[数据目录]\n        AL[告警引擎]\n    end\n    Sources --&gt; Bus --&gt; Consumers</pre><p>设计原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>事件驱动</strong>——采集系统发射事件到消息总线，多个消费者独立消费。避免点对点集成。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等写入</strong>——同一血缘事件重复消费不产生重复记录。用 (job_id, run_id, dataset) 做去重。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进增强</strong>——先采集表级血缘（覆盖广），逐步增强到列级（精度高）。</li>\n<li><strong>容错降级</strong>——某个源的采集失败不影响其他源。失败事件进入死信队列待重试。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"采集覆盖率度量\">采集覆盖率度量</h2><p>采集系统的质量用覆盖率度量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>血缘覆盖率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>有血缘信息的数据资产数</mtext><mtext>目录中总数据资产数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{血缘覆盖率} = \\frac{\\text{有血缘信息的数据资产数}}{\\text{目录中总数据资产数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">血缘覆盖率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目录中总数据资产数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有血缘信息的数据资产数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>目标：生产环境关键资产覆盖率 ≥ 90%。低于此阈值时，优先补齐高影响力资产（核心报表的源表链路、合规审计涉及的 PII 流转路径）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>血缘采集有四条主路径：SQL 解析（精确但受限于静态分析）、执行计划拦截（精确且支持动态 SQL）、OpenLineage 事件（标准化跨工具互操作）、查询历史日志（零侵入但精度有限）。成熟的采集架构混用多种模式，通过事件总线统一消费，以幂等写入和容错降级保证鲁棒性。覆盖率是采集系统的核心度量——关键资产路径不在图中，血缘就失去了价值。</p>\n<p>血缘采集为治理提供了原始数据。但原始的 DAG 数据需要通过<a href=\"lineage-visualization\">可视化与分析</a>才能转化为可操作的洞察。同时，采集的精度和覆盖度直接取决于对<a href=\"lineage-fundamentals\">血缘基础概念</a>中粒度模型的正确选择。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"血缘自动化采集","id":"血缘自动化采集"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采集路径全景","id":"采集路径全景"},{"level":2,"text":"SQL 解析采集","id":"sql-解析采集"},{"level":2,"text":"执行计划拦截","id":"执行计划拦截"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenLineage 标准采集","id":"openlineage-标准采集"},{"level":2,"text":"查询历史日志采集","id":"查询历史日志采集"},{"level":2,"text":"采集架构设计","id":"采集架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"采集覆盖率度量","id":"采集覆盖率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据血缘基础概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/lineage/lineage-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"血缘可视化与影响分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/lineage/lineage-visualization"}}